  "name": "Saanich Inlet Moored Buoy Data, 1999",
  "description": "Chlorophyll, phytoplankton, and nutrient data collected in Saanich Inlet in spring-summer, 1999. Data were collected to support MEOS buoy data (see Marine Ecosystem ObServatory entry) moored in Saanich Inlet.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Data were collected to support MEOS buoy data (see Marine Ecosystem ObServatory entry) moored in Saanich Inlet.\n\nSupplemental information: Risk Justification: Data not secured in regional data centre. Risk of Loss: Medium Impact Justification: Does not affect a wide variety of users. Impact of Loss: Low Recommended Action: Obtain access to data, bring to archives",
